    <string name="capability_in_app_only">Cross-window blur: the system reports it unavailable right now. In-app blur works, so the scratchpad overlay frosts; a panel over another app gets an opaque surface instead, because no app may read another app\'s pixels. Accessibility → “Reduce transparency and blur” turns this off system-wide, and so does battery saver; some devices never had it. This line follows the system, so toggling that setting changes it here without leaving the screen.</string>
